OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures in place for half
OL,4,Amarathon and 10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of rolling road closures will
OL,7,Fbe in place for Leicester's half
OL,8,Fmarathon and 10km (6.2-mile) race on
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FLeicester City Council said more than
OL,12,F5,000 runners were expected to take
OL,13,Fpart in both events.
OL,15,FThe races start and finish at Victoria
OL,16,FPark, from 09:15 BST, with a route
OL,17,Fheading through the city centre and out
OL,18,Fto Thurmaston, Birstall and Watermead
OL,19,FCountry Park.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
