OL,3,GNEWSARoad closures in place for half
OL,4,Amarathon and 10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said parking and loading
OL,7,Frestrictions would be implemented to
OL,8,Fkeep the route free of traffic, and
OL,9,Ftemporary road closures would also be
OL,10,Fin place while the race passes through.
